{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"He gives her a wave. “Hell-o… He-ore. How are you?”","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:37:34.510000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869619537585242163","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Great.  I recently got kicked out of the morticians alliance on both sides of the ocean!\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:38:39.607000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869619810621882398","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"“That… does not… sound great.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:39:03.593000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869619911226433556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"All of the greatest minds get excommunicated. It means my work is on the right track\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:39:51.695000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T16:40:02.495000Z","id":"869620112980856873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"“Which part… do you think?” He seems genuinely curious","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:40:39.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869620312520675329","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Creating new life? making the perfect person?  I have mastered making bodies, but the soul seems so ephemeral, and minds nearly as hard\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:42:02.884000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869620663227400192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"He nods. “The phy-sical is the eas-i-est. Quan-ti-fi-able.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:49:02.895000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869622424881213551","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"correct.  I mean what ingredients and processes can create a mind?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:53:35.250000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869623567220883456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Ah, hello Nolan.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T16:59:45.442000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869625119918661632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"He waves. “Well… ma-gic can… but I think… they are two sides… of same coin.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:00:16.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869625249417822248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"she shrugs \"I know very little of magic.  I just follow the dogma of science\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:03:44.258000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869626121585582200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"“I wish to… learn more sci-ence. To heal. Would you.,. Teach me some of what…. You know?”","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:08:46.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869627390748409926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"she thinks about the question \"I wouldn't say I heal. I build and rebuild.  We are all machines, oil in our veins, capacitors for fat.  Even operating on a person is no more than replacing parts.  With the right fluids, you can make a body accept nearly anything\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:12:39.925000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869628368335798313","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"“You have… a un-ique perspective.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:14:19.709000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869628786860228679","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"she says to herself \"And I am so close.  The flesh lives, but the mind always stops at a point.  Barely able to talk\" she pulls out a notebook and starts writing.  After a moment she looks back up \"sorry, yes, I think people treat bodies as some sort of sacred object.  But its all just meat and machinery.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:16:34.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869629352734785638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"“What do you… think of a soul? Sac-red?”","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:19:30.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869630090231832658","reply_to_id":"869629352734785638","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"A soul is just the core of the person.  Its harder to quantify than even a mind.  if the Mind is thoughts, a soul is the memories.  This is why babies don't have a soul.  They develop them.  First the body, then the mind, finally the soul\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T17:21:37.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869630621503328297","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
